* @title Control flow and indirect goto
* @attribution Griswold 1971, Chapter 1
* @match substring
* @expect >>>
* ONE
* TWO
* THREE
* FOUR
* <<<
          OUTPUT = 'ONE'
          :(L2)
L1        OUTPUT = 'TWO'
          LVAR = 'L3'
          :($LVAR)
L2        IDENT('A', 'A') :S(L1)
L3        DIFFER('A', 'A') :F(L4)
L4        OUTPUT = 'THREE'
          :(L5)
L5        OUTPUT = 'FOUR'
END